From cd2afab5270a0d26b823b165814f76fafef7cdf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Serhii Nikolaichuk <nikolaichuk.s.f@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:00:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] build: take go-gen-ref from the local SIGNER_INFO fix

For the TACRA test deployment: go-gen-ref v1.2.3 with the fix that
reads SIGNING_KEY from bits 4:2 of SIGNER_INFO, so that VLEK-signed
reports (AWS) pass claim extraction.
---
 go.mod |  2 ++
 go.sum | 19 +------------------
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index 535f6e0..8b2980d 100644
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -186,3 +186,5 @@ require (
 	modernc.org/sqlite v1.38.0 // indirect
 	sigs.k8s.io/yaml v1.4.0 // indirect
 )
+
+replace github.com/jraman567/go-gen-ref => ../go-gen-ref-v123
